  "limitations": [
    "Frozen MiniLM encoder; only a small linear classification head is trained. No SetFit encoder fine-tuning.",
    "Authored held-out language, not blind organic user conversations. Classifier scores are uncalibrated.",
    "Subject matching and conversation state are explicit code. Safe source replay remains conservative.",
    "Correct intent does not establish answer correctness or fill missing lore. No production runtime is changed.",
    "The 36-example validation split selected zero score/margin cutoffs; it rejected none of the 48 test questions despite seven classification errors.",
    "Only 1/48 independent cases passed canonical rewrite eligibility; the other cases preserve original wording. Intent recognition improvement does not establish end-to-end answer improvement.",
    "The unchanged frozen evaluation was replayed after structural dialogue/async fixes; it is not a new blind holdout for those fixes.",
    "Timing covers four uncached short questions on the existing desktop Chrome/CPU WASM, not mobile hardware or first internet download."
  ]
}
